依頼で大変恐縮ですが何卒よろしくお願い致します。衣装・髪型・表情・構図等はお任せとさせてください。\n\n参考①\nhttps://x.com/aoisui_/status/1679965240338034688?s=46&t=ZBdpSZK9vsFtaSZzjlbesA\n\n参考②\nhttps://x.com/aoisui_/status/1624362633754464257?s=46&t=ZBdpSZK9vsFtaSZzjlbesA\n\n◾️備考\nもし可能であれば人物と背景をレイヤー分けしたPSDデータで頂けますと幸いです。\n\nお手数ではございますがご確認のほどよろしくお願い致します。", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@eingado/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2483560, "client_id": 2346231, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d738e604/uploads/origins/ab0eda3b-bcca-461f-9a66-53bfdb6109d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2706c7000351ae8fccec038f2981bc65", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d738e604/uploads/origins/ab0eda3b-bcca-461f-9a66-53bfdb6109d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2706c7000351ae8fccec038f2981bc65, https://si.imgix.net/d738e604/uploads/origins/ab0eda3b-bcca-461f-9a66-53bfdb6109d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1348914342af51698e312bf78ccf7a87 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d738e604/uploads/origins/ab0eda3b-bcca-461f-9a66-53bfdb6109d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bc41f3a86e66d406d617600fa644ab4d 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/d738e604/uploads/origins/ab0eda3b-bcca-461f-9a66-53bfdb6109d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=06c4c2122c896ec9e6d8cb00ce611d41", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d738e604/uploads/origins/ab0eda3b-bcca-461f-9a66-53bfdb6109d2?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=06c4c2122c896ec9e6d8cb00ce611d41, https://si.imgix.net/d738e604/uploads/origins/ab0eda3b-bcca-461f-9a66-53bfdb6109d2?bg=%23fff&a